<v Jerome Zerbe>Everything must be charming. And you don't allow the ugly.
<v Jerome Zerbe>一切必须是迷人的。而你不能允许丑陋。

00:57:30.860 --> 00:57:46.560
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周再见，会有更多《美国生活》的故事。

